{"2968540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Choomby", "steam_appid": 2968540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968540/extras/def951f5b3766caa7c55ba2d6abfe13c.avif?t=1781997777\" width=1526 height=130 /></span><strong><u>GAME MODES:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◯ Hive Survival ◯ Escape ◯ Football ◯ Elimination Run ◯ Arena</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968540/extras/aff1530a5e079862cbbfc22749ec0d2d.poster.avif?t=1781997777\" width=720 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968540/extras/aff1530a5e079862cbbfc22749ec0d2d.webm?t=1781997777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOMBY</strong> is an online game about the adventures and rivalry of insects. The game mode depends on the chosen map. The Spider won’t leave you alone and blocks your freedom to fly wherever you want. Collect pollen and build a base that can strike back at the Spider!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968540/extras/b9e3f85a1279eddb4f296381dfb8e4c9.webp?t=1781997777\" width=629 height=39 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The main feature</strong> — <strong>one strong player faces off against many weaker ones</strong>. To defeat the powerful, the weak must work together and take on different roles.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In addition, thanks to a variety of maps and modes, you can play <strong>tag with infection</strong>, explore <strong>mazes and traps</strong>, compete in <strong>football matches</strong>, enjoy <strong>elimination mini-games</strong>, or take part in <strong>base capture battles (PvP / PvPvE)</strong>. <br> <br> <u>Peculiarities:</u>     <br> - Adventure  <br> - Feel like an insect  <br> - Base construction  <br> - Various game modes  <br> - Asymmetrical multiplayer</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968540/extras/b9e3f85a1279eddb4f296381dfb8e4c9.webp?t=1781997777\" width=629 height=39 /></span>  </h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968540/extras/def951f5b3766caa7c55ba2d6abfe13c.avif?t=1781997777\" width=1526 height=130 /></span><strong><u>GAME MODES:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◯ Hive Survival ◯ Escape ◯ Football ◯ Elimination Run ◯ Arena</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968540/extras/aff1530a5e079862cbbfc22749ec0d2d.poster.avif?t=1781997777\" width=720 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968540/extras/aff1530a5e079862cbbfc22749ec0d2d.webm?t=1781997777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOMBY</strong> is an online game about the adventures and rivalry of insects. The game mode depends on the chosen map. The Spider won’t leave you alone and blocks your freedom to fly wherever you want. Collect pollen and build a base that can strike back at the Spider!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968540/extras/b9e3f85a1279eddb4f296381dfb8e4c9.webp?t=1781997777\" width=629 height=39 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The main feature</strong> — <strong>one strong player faces off against many weaker ones</strong>. To defeat the powerful, the weak must work together and take on different roles.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In addition, thanks to a variety of maps and modes, you can play <strong>tag with infection</strong>, explore <strong>mazes and traps</strong>, compete in <strong>football matches</strong>, enjoy <strong>elimination mini-games</strong>, or take part in <strong>base capture battles (PvP / PvPvE)</strong>. <br> <br> <u>Peculiarities:</u>     <br> - Adventure  <br> - Feel like an insect  <br> - Base construction  <br> - Various game modes  <br> - Asymmetrical multiplayer</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968540/extras/b9e3f85a1279eddb4f296381dfb8e4c9.webp?t=1781997777\" width=629 height=39 /></span>  </h2>", "short_description": "CHOOMBY - an online game of bees vs. spider! One powerful player hunts, while the others must unite to survive and strike back. Enjoy diverse maps and modes: infection tag, trap-filled mazes, football, elimination mini-games, and base capture (PvP / PvPvE).", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Latin America, Simplified Chinese, Polish, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968540/2c88eef8bf63f2408ea31170849185f98ac22e27/header.jpg?t=1781997777", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968540/4b960bf9952f3476b29c1800578ad73f2823081a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781997777", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968540/4b960bf9952f3476b